<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cementos Diamante started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cementos Diamante started.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Paribas analyst Peregrine Winfield said he started coverage of Colombia's Cementos Diamante with a buy rating.</p>
<p>- &quot;Operating margins to expand to 28.7 percent in 1997 from 13.6 percent (proforma 1995). ...Cemex is a world-class cement operator with a proven track record of stripping costs from acquisitions...</p>
<p>-- Savings of $29 million have already been identified.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
